    "For controllers your iPhone clips into, like Backbone or Kishi: if the first controller has no rumble motors or motion sensors, your iPhone fills in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "适用于 Backbone、Kishi 等夹持式手柄：如果第一个手柄没有震动马达或体感，将由 iPhone 代替。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "適用於 Backbone、Kishi 等夾持式控制器：若第一個控制器沒有震動馬達或動作感應器，將改由 iPhone 提供。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "適用於 Backbone、Kishi 等夾持式手掣：如第一個手掣沒有震動摩打或動作感應器，將由 iPhone 代替。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example, 192.168.1.10 or 192.168.1.10:47989. The host needs to be running Sunshine or GeForce Experience." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
