    "Local Cursor keeps the pointer visible and moves it directly, which suits remote desktop use. Some games don't support it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本地光标会保持指针可见并直接定位，适合远程桌面，但部分游戏不支持。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本機游標會保持指標可見並直接定位，適合遠端桌面，但部分遊戲不支援。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本機游標會保持指標可見並直接定位，適合遙距桌面，但部分遊戲不支援。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for Sunshine hosts on your local network. You can also add a host by its address." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在局域网中查找运行 Sunshine 的主机，你也可以手动添加主机地址。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
